<title>USA: Jameson Inns Inc Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>Jameson Inns Inc Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended March 31</p>
<p>							   1997	 1996</p>
<p> Revenues					 $2,735,543 $1,915,590</p>
<p>Net Income Before Extraordinary Item</p>
<p>						     1,210,869    338,504</p>
<p>Net Income Before Extraordinary Item Per Share</p>
<p>							     .15	  .09</p>
<p> Net Income					  521,327    338,504</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share				  .06	  .09</p>
<p> Funds From Operations			 2,096,621    948,893</p>
